WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:29.830
I'm not a robot, I'm a machine, so I know what's going on.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:50.480
to the

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:10.080
None of them will be of any use!

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.730
Don't I have a single-handed general?

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:16.040
At this rate, I won't be able to face the Emperor of Darkness!

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:17.470
Grand Shogun of the Dark!

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.240
Hm?

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.660
Grand Shogun of Angolas!

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:25.740
I'm sorry, but I've sent Gilei to Mikeros.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:28.100
Please let me go, Grand Shogun of the Dark!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.000
All right, if that's all you have to say, then go!

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.640
Come at me as hard as you can!

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.110
Thank you for your happiness!

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:43.120
I've collected all the guns in the battle.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.760
All right, let's go!

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.320
This is my first battle!

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.760
Don't lose, Mikurosu!

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:51.890
Awaken, Shiro!

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.940
The end of a battle without love!

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:12.260
Hurry up! I don't have a chance anymore!

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:13.780
Tch, that's enough.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.920
If you promised me such an important thing,

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.340
you should just sleep.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.260
I don't care, hurry up!

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:20.660
I got it, I got it.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.310
Just be a little more quiet.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.130
What?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:36.760
What's wrong?

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.830
How's Haruna Shiratori?

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.850
She went home a little while ago.

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:44.370
Oh, I see.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:50.400
Oh, Shiro!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:55.900
Don't do such a pitiful thing!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.190
I can't do it anymore!

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.000
Shiro!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.820
Haruna-chan might still be there.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.540
That dog always comes with Haruna-chan.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:15.700
You're so innocent.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:24.200
-Give it back! -Give it back!

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.150
Do it with me!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.980
Don't be so cocky, Chibi!

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:48.640
Are you going to do it?

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.290
That guy!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:04.210
-You bastard! -I'll kill you!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:05.990
-You bastard! -I'll kill you!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:16.480
-You bastard! -I'll kill you!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.070
Listen to me.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.850
Let's go! Let's go!

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.040
You're an idiot.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.570
It's bad for you to fight without knowing your own strength.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:37.920
This date is a mess, isn't it?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.240
Remember this.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.270
I'll definitely beat you up.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:55.990
Don't worry.

00:04:55.990 --> 00:05:00.000
We're friends with Coach Kabuto, who's doing his best in America.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.940
I have the responsibility to make you a man a year older than me.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:03.900
Be patient.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.240
Muki! Don't hold back! Keep going!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.590
Hori! It's here! Don't let it get to you!

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.160
Come on, Shiro!

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:25.290
Alright, alright! Hori! It's right there!

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:26.910
That's it!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:28.710
That's it!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.280
Have a good trip back home, Chiyo.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.980
Shiro, you've been trying so hard since you were rejected by me, haven't you?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.300
I wasn't trying to show my cool side to my girlfriend.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:46.020
I was trying to show her how much of a loser I am.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.240
I'm sure you're disappointed, aren't you?

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.280
That's enough!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.480
But the leader is that boss.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.700
I'm worried about what will happen to Shiro.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.990
Hey, you're making a lot of noise, Shiro.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.270
But if you go too far, it will have a negative effect.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:59.420
Now, that's enough. You can go home.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.000
That's enough!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.540
I'll surprise them right now!

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.380
That's right! That's what I'm talking about, Shiro!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.310
Tomorrow, I'm going to have a duel with him!

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.400
A duel?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.460
Well, that's fine. Let's go home.

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.430
I'll take you with me.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.840
You're laughing, aren't you?

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:21.830
Ikeros, don't get too close to the science fortress research facility.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:23.940
It's not good to be detected by a radar.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.170
Send the combatants there.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:26.810
Yes, sir.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:29.190
I understand, General Tankokutai.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.770
Damn it! What's going on?

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.110
They came all the way to the front line and they won't let us out!

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:41.070
General Angolas, what are you going to do about Gira?

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:43.380
Mikaenes, you're more important than Gira!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.650
Huh?

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:50.680
Mikaenes, take the special forces with you and send them to the basement of the science fortress research facility.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.110
Gira will use you as their bodyguard.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:30.000
Keep an eye on him until his mission is completed.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.600
Something is moving around here.

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.380
What on earth is going on here?

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.280
Oh, Director, look!

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:37.250
What?

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.480
What is this?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.150
It looks like a battle gun.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:46.570
All right, let's get out of here and investigate.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.770
Hey, Tetsuya, we're getting close to the lab.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.250
Be careful.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.020
Engine start!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:08:00.000
Brain Condor, switch on!

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:45.530
Double time!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.640
Boss, what are you talking about?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:51.440
Forget about it!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.400
What? What is it?

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:58.300
What's going on? Get out of the way!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.000
What? Tetsuya is now...

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.120
What did you say?

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:05.040
Boss, if you don't do your best this time, you'll be sorry for Mr. Kabuto!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.110
I know!

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:15.180
Retyan, the enemy is coming right up.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:15.960
Roger that.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.020
Scramble off!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.420
That guy...

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:35.570
This is your chance!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.550
You might be able to defeat the Great Majinga!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.550
Do it!

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:46.970
I'll get rid of him no matter what.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.800
I won't let you get close to this fortress!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:56.600
Boomerang!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.100
I'm not going to let you get away with this!

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:19.790
Get out of here with your magic power!

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.620
If you don't, you'll be crushed by the water pressure!

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.620
Damn it!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.320
Magic power!

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.340
Irai, wait!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.010
Your repairs are next!

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:37.350
Pull yourself together!

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:42.840
I've started the set of the dimensional bombs.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:44.740
Now it's my turn!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:52.690
The fate of the science fortress research institute is in the hands of the wind!

00:10:52.690 --> 00:11:00.000
Don't be so frustrated.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.500
-What if he dies? -I'm not joking.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:06.400
They must be repairing the battle guns.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:11.780
We need to get the Great Majingers out of here as soon as possible.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.720
I'll beat them to death this time.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.950
Why? You're laughing at me,

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.830
but you'll be upset if Tetsuya loses.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:21.890
Shiro!

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:25.870
You don't want to help me even if I want to get stronger?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.940
It's up to you! I'm going!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:30.000
Shiro!

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.720
-You can't fight with me. -Den, leave me alone.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:36.340
It's more important that you understand it yourself rather than us.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.280
A male or a female?

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:14.280
What do you mean, male?

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.040
You're a crow and you're an idiot!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.700
Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:19.690
You're too violent, Siro!

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.180
Hehe, it's because I'm being careless.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.800
Look at this, remember this!

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:52.650
Job, can I go play with you?

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:54.000
Sure.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.400
Haruna-chan, it's time for the live stream.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.000
I won't lose even if I'm the first one to come out.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.680
I don't care about that.

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:05.640
They might want to be friends.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.560
But they might be bullying us again.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:09.560
Oh!

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:11.420
I knew it.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.420
Shiro, don't fight.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:14.420
I won't.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.420
I'll take revenge for yesterday.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.240
I'll show them my power.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:20.240
Hey, Haruna, go to school with me.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.320
Go away.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.320
Let's go to school together.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.320
Stop it, Haruna.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.460
Shut up.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:27.470
You keep quiet.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.470
Go away.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.470
Stop it.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:30.000
Oh!

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.790
Damn you, you bastard!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.280
I won't hold back today!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.550
I don't need to hold back!

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:39.550
-Shiro-kun, stop it! -It's okay!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.450
-What? -Come on!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.710
-You bastard! -You bastard!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.460
You're really amazing, Shiro.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.820
Not really, but...

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:08.880
I can't take it anymore. I don't like people who fight.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.300
What?

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:17.240
General Angolas, repair of the gilai has been completed.

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:19.150
All right. Go to the gilai.

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:22.820
I was in trouble last night, but the set of the dimensional bombs will be over soon.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.710
Guard the special forces well.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:27.510
If you're caught now, all your efforts will be in vain.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.000
Great Majin Buu!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:42.930
Then leave it to me!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.410
Tetsuya-kun, are you still there?

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:49.490
The enemy fortress is heading towards the city!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.140
Captain!

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.560
An abnormal radio wave is coming from the bottom of the laboratory!

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.160
Alright, get down to that position!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:55.700
Yes sir!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.450
You need to hurry up!

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:03.590
The battleships are coming from the sea too!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:08.900
The strategy is to attack from the sky and the sea, right?

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.940
Majin Go!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:15.800
Here we go!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:26.110
Fire on!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.490
The Demajin is coming out!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:30.000
Mikenes!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.070
I'll be your opponent, so hang in there!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:32.920
Yes, sir!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.130
I'll do my best!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:50.380
Oh, Shiro-kun, Haruna-chan.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.000
Boki-san!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:52.950
It's dangerous to be outside.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.870
Come to the church, come on, come on.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:04.350
-Is that him? -Yes, it's Big Brother Tetsuya.

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:07.110
-It's the same big brother, isn't it? -Yes, it is.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:08.980
Let's pray for him.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.960
Let's pray for his safety.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:12.670
That's fine.

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:16.170
With the Great Majingers, we can win for sure.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.490
Shiro!

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:27.320
Tetsuya, don't follow the enemy's lead.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.090
Get away from the city.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:13.380
God, please protect Tsurugi Tetsuya and his comrades.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:17.430
God, please protect Tsurugi Tetsuya and his comrades.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.620
Tch! That kind of prayer is useless!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.280
Shiro, the prayer of the heart is the heart of love.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:26.080
No matter how strong the person who has lost the heart of love is,

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:30.000
he is just a violent person.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.000
The end of the story is unfortunate.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:39.890
I don't understand that. It's too difficult.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:47.020
Don't lose to the bad guys!

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:47.910
Take this!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:50.350
Let's go!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.120
Take this!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:24.580
-It's a dimensional bomb! -It's approaching, be careful!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.650
-Roger! -Hey, Jun!

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:35.750
Please take the dimensional bomb from the rescue ship's sea.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:39.450
But I can't do anything in this outfit!

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.340
Jun, watch out!

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:55.720
Thanks to you, I'm fine now.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.780
Come on!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:58.780
You bastard!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.000
I'm so jealous!

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:20.460
Get out of the way!

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:23.080
The atomic bomb is exploding!

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.070
Hurry up and come back!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.150
A time bomb is being launched in the area.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.150
What? A time bomb?

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:56.440
Release! Trouble Dance!

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:03.570
Dekuya-kun, hurry up! The research institute will be blown away!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.220
Jun and the Bosses are in a pinch too!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:21.420
Just hang in there a little longer!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.000
I won't let you get away with this again!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:35.080
Take this!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:45.170
Pressure Parts!

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.490
Tetsuya...

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:50.390
I'm sorry.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.680
Giraimei!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:56.300
I can't believe you couldn't move thanks to that little thing!

00:20:56.300 --> 00:21:00.000
You were so close to the Great Majinga, but...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:15.650
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to hurt you!

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:28.740
You're so annoying!

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:29.480
Stop it!

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.280
Hey, you meanie! You're so mean!

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:36.060
You're going to have to suffer a little, Shiro!

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.020
How's that? How's that?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:41.120
Stop it! God is going to be angry with you!

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.420
Hey, look at that!

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.800
You meanie! You meanie! Look at that!

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.000
Come on, come on, come on!

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:53.920
Shiro! Shiro, are you okay?

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:56.890
Shiro, if you don't have a loving heart,

00:21:56.890 --> 00:21:59.890
you'll be punished for bragging about your strength.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.960
Take a look at Tetsuya Onii-san.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:09.460
The reason he is a true hero is because he has the kind heart you had for your dog.

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:11.660
Don't you think so, Shiro-kun?

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:38.340
I've got to look back at my brother.

00:22:38.340 --> 00:22:42.240
He's fighting for the people around him rather than for himself.

00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:44.280
He's a lot different from me, isn't he?

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:51.610
Ehehehe, after all, Shiro-kun is shit, isn't he?

00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:52.470
H-H-Really?

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:01.140
Let's go together!

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:04.130
I'll introduce you to Tetsuya once again, okay?

00:23:45.800 --> 00:23:46.520
Done.

00:24:31.980 --> 00:24:35.800
A fierce bull appeared in Tetsuya's entrance competition.

00:24:35.800 --> 00:24:40.240
The bull transformed into Milma and attacked Tetsuya as Bisonia, a giant battle beast.

00:24:40.240 --> 00:24:44.970
The Buu-Natsu that was dispatched was also struggling with the violence of Bisonia.

00:24:44.970 --> 00:24:50.550
Tetsuya rushed to dock with Maginger, but it was impossible in Bisonia's missile attack.

00:24:50.550 --> 00:24:52.690
Next time, Great Maginger.

00:24:52.690 --> 00:24:56.120
Please look forward to Mougyu Bisonia's counterattack!
